:"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p029","text":"穆王立五十五年，崩，子共王繄扈立。共王游於涇上，密康公從，有三女奔之。其母曰：「必致之王。夫獸三為群，人三為眾，女三為粲。王田不取群，公行不下眾，王御不參一族。夫粲，美之物也。眾以美物歸女，而何德以堪之？王猶不堪，況爾之小醜乎！小醜備物，終必亡。」康公不獻，一年，共王滅密。共王崩，子懿王艱立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m029-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"穆王","kind":"person","person_id":"sx2_wyn_nhr","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m029-0011","start":11,"end":15,"surface":"共王繄扈","kind":"person","person_id":"x2m_k5j_fdz","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m029-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"共王","kind":"person","person_id":"x2m_k5j_fdz","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m029-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"密康公","kind":"person","person_id":"ojk_hex_iha","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m029-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"三女","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m029-0036","start":36,"end":37,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"is6_glb_qw5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依密康公與其母的本段對話；不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m029-0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"康公","kind":"person","person_id":"ojk_hex_iha","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m029-0132","start":132,"end":134,"surface":"共王","kind":"person","person_id":"x2m_k5j_fdz","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m029-0137","start":137,"end":139,"surface":"共王","kind":"person","person_id":"x2m_k5j_fdz","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m029-0142","start":142,"end":145,"surface":"懿王艱","kind":"person","person_id":"3jt_de3_wuf","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p003","text":"其玄孫曰中潏，在西戎，保西垂。生蜚廉。蜚廉生惡來。惡來有力，蜚廉善走，父子俱以材力事殷紂。周武王之伐紂，并殺惡來。是時蜚廉為紂石北方，還，無所報，為壇霍太山而報，得石棺，銘曰「帝令處父不與殷亂，賜爾石棺以華氏」。死，遂葬於霍太山。蜚廉復有子曰季勝。季勝生孟增。孟增幸於周成王，是為宅皋狼。皋狼生衡父，衡父生造父。造父以善御幸於周繆王，得驥、溫驪、驊騮、騄耳之駟，西巡狩，樂而忘歸。徐偃王作亂，造父為繆王御，長驅歸周，一日千里以救亂。繆王以趙城封造父，造父族由此為趙氏。自蜚廉生季勝已下五世至造父，別居趙。趙衰其後也。惡來革者，蜚廉子也，蚤死。有子曰女防。女防生旁皋，旁皋生太幾，太幾生大駱，大駱生非子。以造父之寵，皆蒙趙城，姓趙氏。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"其玄孫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或未核定指代；未由熟知世系補造人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"中潏","kind":"person","person_id":"yeo_6mv_tut","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"蜚廉","kind":"person","person_id":"8gd_zz1_8a3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"蜚廉","kind":"person","person_id":"8gd_zz1_8a3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"惡來","kind":"person","person_id":"9rl_u52_5fz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"惡來","kind":"person","person_id":"9rl_u52_5fz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"蜚廉","kind":"person","person_id":"8gd_zz1_8a3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"殷紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0045","start":45,"end":48,"surface":"周武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"惡來","kind":"person","person_id":"9rl_u52_5fz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m003-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"蜚廉","kind":"p